(252, 'Field visit report', 'Dear ED

Site twasuye irimo kubakwa mu Busanza, yubakwa na SEZAME Group Company. Twasanze umu supplier wabo w''imbaho ari Shumbusho Primie, Twamuhamagaye tumubaza uko akorana n''umukozi wa Association atubwirako bakorana umunsi kuwundi, kandi ko n''imbaho twahasanze yamaze kuzitangira umusoro. Fisto nawe yatwemereye ko yazimusoreye ariko akaba atari yakageze hano kuri iyi nyubako.Ytatubwiye ko company yamusabye kuzana Machine kugirango bajye babona uko banasatura za MUBA. Twavuganye n''umkozi wakira akanabara izo mbaho tumuhuza na Fisto, twumvikana ko azajya amuha imibare y''imbaho yakiriye kugirango zikorerwe fagitire. Bahanye numero kandi yatwijeje ko bazajya bahana amakuru umwanya kuwundi. Natwe tuzakomeza gukurikirana ko bikorwa neza.

Murakoze.', 'general', '5', NULL, 7, '2026-09-18 09:57:59', '2026-09-18 09:57:59', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
