The problem was that I didn''t check well .
I apologize for not getting attention to my report.

I informed the client about the issue then he agreed to pay the rest 52,933 Frw.

Thank you.', '2026-09-17 14:33:03'),
(23, 1346, 3, 'Ok,Such deficit of August will be considered next month (September) by deducting collected amount(MSF).
So now your report approved.', '2026-09-17 16:01:11'),
(24, 1385, 106, 'Good afternoon sir, thank you for the feedback. the discrepancy of 140272 is froma member who paid for ntwk and the amount was added in september. that is why the difference  
