(27, 1365, 81, 'Good evening Sir,

we hope this message find you well, I would like to clarify the source of surplus amounting to 5,612 Rwf in report of August 2026. In reality, this surplus came from unexpected source of clients whereby some clients transacted little more amount of money than amount that they could transact. This little increment of single transaction for some individual clients added up in a month to  5,612 Rwf, hence the source of this unexpected surplus of August 2026 report.

Thank you!', '2026-09-17 19:48:23'),
(28, 1365, 3, 'OK.', '2026-09-18 08:25:28'),
(29, 1630, 72, 'dear sir, The surplus amount of 29860rwf  reflected in my  August  monthly report was paid by a client without my knowledge. the client did not inform that the payment had been made,nor did he ask me to issue a receipt.
since i did not receive the MOMO PAY notification ,Iwas not aware that the payment had been made.Later ,the client informed that he was the one who had made the payment.
therefore,the receipt for this payment will be issued in semtember so that the amount can be properly accounted for in the report.
the payment was made by intambwe cooperative.

thank you!', '2026-09-18 09:54:36'),
