<ul>
    <li>Design orientations of the Association</li>
    <li>Adopt or modify statutes and the internal rules and regulations of the Association</li>
    <li>Approve the annual budget and action plan</li>
    <li>Elect the Executive, Advisory and audit committees</li>
    <li>Set rules for membership contribution</li>
    <li>Approve the annual report of the Executive Committee and Audit Committee</li>
    <li>Decide on the dissolution of the Association</li>
    <li>Approve, suspend or exclude a member</li>
    <li>Decide on how to allocate assets after liquidation</li>
</ul>', 1, 1, '2025-10-08 18:44:30', '2025-10-08 18:44:30'),
(2, 'Advisory Committee', 'advisory-committee', 'middle', 'ADVISORY COMMITTEE', '<p>The Advisory Committee provides strategic guidance and expert advice to the organization.</p>
<h3>Key Responsibilities:</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Provide strategic direction and policy recommendations</li>
    <li>Review and advise on major initiatives and programs</li>
    <li>Offer expertise in specialized areas</li>
    <li>Support the Executive Committee in decision-making</li>
    <li>Monitor organizational performance and effectiveness</li>
</ul>', 1, 1, '2025-10-08 18:44:30', '2025-10-08 18:44:30'),
(3, 'Executive Committee', 'executive-committee', 'middle', 'EXECUTIVE COMMITTEE', '<p>The Executive Committee is responsible for the day-to-day management and implementation of the organization''s activities.</p>
<h3>Main Functions:</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Implement decisions and policies of the General Assembly</li>
    <li>Manage daily operations and administration</li>
    <li>Prepare annual budgets and action plans</li>
    <li>Coordinate activities across all departments</li>
    <li>Represent the organization externally</li>
    <li>Report to the General Assembly on organizational activities</li>
</ul>', 2, 1, '2025-10-08 18:44:30', '2025-10-08 18:44:30'),
(4, 'Audit Committee', 'audit-committee', 'middle', 'AUDIT COMMITTEE', '<p>The Audit Committee ensures financial integrity and compliance with regulations and policies.</p>
<h3>Core Responsibilities:</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Review financial statements and reports</li>
    <li>Monitor internal controls and risk management</li>
    <li>Ensure compliance with legal and regulatory requirements</li>
    <li>Oversee internal and external audit processes</li>
    <li>Report findings to the General Assembly</li>
</ul>', 3, 1, '2025-10-08 18:44:30', '2025-10-08 18:44:30'),
(5, 'Technical Commissions', 'technical-commissions', 'bottom', 'TECHNICAL COMMISSIONS', '<p>Technical Commissions handle specialized technical matters and provide expert guidance in specific domains.</p>
<h3>Areas of Focus:</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Develop technical standards and guidelines</li>
    <li>Provide technical expertise and support</li>
    <li>Review and approve technical projects</li>
    <li>Conduct technical assessments and evaluations</li>
    <li>Facilitate knowledge sharing and capacity building</li>
</ul>', 1, 1, '2025-10-08 18:44:30', '2025-10-08 18:44:30'),
(6, 'Arbitration', 'arbitration', 'bottom', 'ARBITRATION', '<p>The Arbitration unit handles dispute resolution and mediation services.</p>
<h3>Key Functions:</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Handle dispute resolution between members</li>
    <li>Provide mediation services</li>
    <li>Ensure fair and impartial conflict resolution</li>
    <li>Maintain arbitration records and documentation</li>
    <li>Develop arbitration procedures and guidelines</li>
</ul>', 2, 1, '2025-10-08 18:44:30', '2025-10-08 18:44:30'),
(7, 'Executive Secretariat', 'executive-secretariat', 'bottom', 'EXECUTIVE SECRETARIAT', '<p>The Executive Secretariat provides administrative and operational support to the organization.</p>
<h3>Main Responsibilities:</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Provide administrative support to all committees</li>
    <li>Manage organizational documentation and records</li>
    <li>Coordinate meetings and events</li>
    <li>Handle internal and external communications</li>
    <li>Support implementation of organizational decisions</li>
</ul>', 3, 1, '2025-10-08 18:44:30', '2025-10-08 18:44:30');











