(46, 292, NULL, 'Dear IT, Thank you for your detailed report and for the technical support you provided to Odile. We appreciate your efforts in attempting to resolve the issue and your clear recommendation following the feedback from RRA.
Since we are moving forward with this purchase, I would like to request that you advise and guide the Procurement team on the specific model to acquire. Please ensure the new device meets the key criteria it must be fully capable of running our QuickBooks software seamlessly.
As the management was decided that next time, we have to procure a device powerful enough that the employee will not require a laptop in addition to the iPad for their daily tasks. Please share the specific technical requirements with the with Procurement team.
Thank you again for your hard work and proactive support.
Best regards,', 1, '2026-04-13 09:28:42', '2026-04-13 09:28:42'),
