<p><font color="#000000"><i>Dear Emmanuel,&nbsp;</i></font></p><p><span style="color:black"><i>This is to kindly request transport arrangement for enable Danny and me to attend the&nbsp;meeting organized between RWVCA and NIRDA on Wednesday 29th July 2026 at STEM/IAF&nbsp;
09:30 am.</i></span></p><p><span style="color:black"><i>Thank you.</i></span></p>

