(14, 'Car wash prac RAI905C', 'Ndasaba kogesha mukindi kinamba bagapfubura kuko imaze igihe tioga ngo icye neza!, nkaba nasabaga ko mwampa uburenganzira tukayijyana ahandi bayoza neza.<div>Murakoze.</div>', '2026-08-18 13:15:00', '2026-08-18 15:30:00', 'Car Wash', NULL, '2026-08-18', 6, 102, 7, 5, 7, 'pending', 'pending', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'no', 'reverted', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'pending', NULL, NULL, 'Kosora message yawe wanditse ntabwo ivugitse neza. Saba ko wajya mu kinamba cya kicukiro centere kugirango bayoze neza kurushaho kuberako ikinamba kitwegereye hari ibyo kitabasha kunoza kubera ko bafite ibikoresho bishya, hanyuma ubutaha izogerezwa ku kinamba cya bugufi kuko izaba idafite umwanda mwinshi. Urebe uburyo message igaragazamo ikinyabupfura kuko nakiriya kiroza ku rwego rwacyo ntabwo twakoresha ijambo gupfubura, Murakoze.', '2026-08-18 10:09:41', 7, 'Kosora message yawe wanditse ntabwo ivugitse neza. Saba ko wajya mu kinamba cya kicukiro centere kugirango bayoze neza kurushaho kuberako ikinamba kitwegereye hari ibyo kitabasha kunoza kubera ko bafite ibikoresho bishya, hanyuma ubutaha izogerezwa ku kinamba cya bugufi kuko izaba idafite umwanda mwinshi. Urebe uburyo message igaragazamo ikinyabupfura kuko nakiriya kiroza ku rwego rwacyo ntabwo twakoresha ijambo gupfubura, Murakoze.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-18 09:12:16', '2026-08-18 10:09:41'),
