(16, 'Desktop Computer Issue', 'Dear Emmy,

I hope you are doing well.

Attached below are the details of the desktop computer issue. As I previously informed you, the computer was working at the time I handed it over. However, during the return process, I found that it was no longer working. You also mentioned earlier that the PC was not functioning.

The issue appears to be caused by the computer not detecting the disk that contains the operating system. This indicates that the device requires technical maintenance or attention from the person in charge of IT maintenance.

Thank you for your understanding.

Kind regards,
Daniel', 'resolved', 'high', 7, 2, 'technical', '1770733040_e3dd9fc2ec0b65b2.jpeg|WhatsApp Image 2026-02-10 at 16.04.22.jpeg', '2026-02-10 16:17:20', '2026-03-18 17:41:42', '2026-03-18 17:41:42'),
