(49, 34, 'pending', 4, 'Leave request submitted by employee', '2026-03-25 13:02:20'),
(50, 33, 'reverted', 1, 'Dear Claudine,\\r\\nIf you would like to take 8 days of leave starting on March 30th, your leave period will end on April 10th, and you will be expected back in the office on April 13th, 2026.\\r\\nPlease verify these dates and update your leave form accordingly.', '2026-03-25 15:56:25'),
(51, 33, 'resubmitted', 4, 'Request edited and resubmitted after revision', '2026-03-26 08:28:19'),
(52, 4, 'resubmitted', 75, 'Request edited and resubmitted after revision', '2026-03-27 11:37:33'),
(53, 33, 'reverted', 1, 'Dear Claudine, \\r\\nI’m returning this request because there is a discrepancy in the remaining balance. You currently have 27 total leave days. If we deduct the 8 days from this request, your new balance would be 19 days, not 27.\\r\\nPlease cancel this digital request so we can proceed with the hard copy version we both signed last week.\\r\\nThank you for your understanding.', '2026-03-30 05:36:00'),
(54, 4, 'reverted', 1, 'Dear Alphonse,\\r\\nFollowing our phone conversation, I am writing to formally notify you that your leave request cannot be approved at this time due to current staffing levels.\\r\\nAs we discussed, the Gisozi team normally consists of three employees. Because one of your colleagues has been temporarily deployed to another site for approximately three months, the team is currently down to only two people. To ensure operational continuity, we require the remaining team members to be present until her return, at which point you will be able to take your leave.\\r\\nPlease revise your request to align with her expected return date.\\r\\nIf you have an urgent need for this leave such that your absence would cause significant issues, please come to the HR office so we can discuss it and find a solution together.\\r\\nThank you for your understanding.\\r\\nBest regards, HR\\r\\n', '2026-03-30 05:52:08'),
(55, 35, 'pending', 79, 'Leave request submitted by employee', '2026-03-30 10:50:55'),
(117, 61, 'resubmitted', 101, 'Request edited and resubmitted after revision', '2026-05-04 15:39:01'),
(118, 61, 'verified_by_hr', 1, '', '2026-05-04 15:40:37'),
(119, 61, 'approved', 5, 'Approved', '2026-05-05 06:15:58'),
(120, 62, 'verified_by_hr', 1, '', '2026-05-05 08:04:32'),
(121, 62, 'approved', 5, '', '2026-05-05 14:24:07'),
(56, 35, 'reverted', 1, 'Dear Jeanne,\\r\\nIn reference to Article 8 of your employment contract, employees are entitled to 18 working days of paid leave per year. Based on your current accrual, you are eligible to take only six (6) days of leave in April 2026. The remaining days will become available as they are earned later in the year. Please revise your leave request accordingly and resubmit it for further process. Best regards, HR', '2026-03-31 14:12:12'),
(57, 35, 'resubmitted', 79, 'Request edited and resubmitted after revision', '2026-04-01 10:58:18'),
(58, 36, 'pending', 6, 'Leave request submitted by employee', '2026-04-02 11:15:56'),
(59, 36, 'verified_by_hr', 1, '', '2026-04-02 11:29:00'),
(60, 35, 'reverted', 1, 'Dear Jeanne,\\r\\nRegarding this leave request, we are unfortunately unable to approve it at this time. Due to the temporary redeployment of Moses to Gisozi, your presence is essential to ensure operational continuity in your site.\\r\\nWe understand the importance of taking your leave. HR is committed to ensuring that all staff members take their annual leave before the end of the year. We will review your request again as soon as a replacement or an alternative solution is found, or upon Moses’s return. If you have an urgent personal matter that requires your absence, please feel free to visit the HR office so we can discuss it and find a solution together.\\r\\nThank you for your understanding and your dedication during this period.\\r\\nBest regards,', '2026-04-02 12:20:35'),
(61, 36, 'approved', 5, 'ok.', '2026-04-02 13:29:49'),
