(155, 73, 'reverted', 1, 'Dear Niyonshuti,\\r\\n\\r\\nPlease revise your leave request form and ensure that the number of leave days is calculated correctly. If you plan to start your leave on 15/07 and return on 31/07, the requested leave period is 14 days, not 15 days. As a result, your remaining leave balance should be 7 days instead of 6 days. Please let me know if you need any further clarification.', '2026-06-11 07:51:49'),
