(333, 'ICPC RUSIZI WEEKLY REPORT FROM 01/04/2026 TO 05/04/2026', 'Weekly', '<p>Mwaramutse neza </p><p>amahoro y''imana abane namwe </p><p>natwe irusizi iki cyumweruc yashije ntankuru gusa nubwo abacuruzi baba ntakazi bafite ariko </p><p>ntabwo habura imbogamizi gs inyinshi n''izisanzwe ariko tugiye kugerageaza tubikoreho</p>', '2026-04-06', '2026-04-06', 113, '2026-04-14 10:17:05', '2026-04-14 10:17:05', '12:03:00', '12:30:00', 'RUSIZI'),
(334, 'RUSIZI WEEKLY REPORT FROM 06/04/ TO 12/04/2026', 'Weekly', '<p>MWIRIWE NEZA </p><p>Turongeye turabasuhuje amahoro y''imana abane namwe ,Irusizi natwe tumeze neza ,turashima imana icyiturinze</p><p>icyumweru gishize i wacu I Rusizi twatangije gahunda yo kubuza abacuruzi kumena imbaho bafite izindi batasoreye</p><p>nubwo tutabyumva kimwe nabamwe mubo tubana nabo ariko bamwe muribo barabyumva cyane kuko basorera kugihe abandi batabyumva </p><p>ni babandi nubundi tudakorana neza ariko turabizezako haricyo bizahindura mumikorere yacu.</p><p>   </p><p>gusa wa mucuruzi uvugako atazasora RWVCA bataramuha amafranga bamufite namaginga aya ntakintu ashaka kuntangariza arko we imodoka niye </p><p>yambwiyeko ntazamubuza kumena mu isambu yishyurira imisoro ,ngo tuzabanza tubahe amafaranga yabo</p><p><br></p>', '2026-04-14', '2026-04-14', 113, '2026-04-14 10:30:39', '2026-04-14 10:30:39', '12:18:00', '12:24:00', 'RUSIZI'),
