(408, 'RUSIZI ICPCs WEEKLY REPORT FRO 13/04 TO 19/04/2026', 'Weekly', '<p>Mwaramutse neza</p><p>natwe dukomeje gushima imana kubwo ikomeje kuturinda twese </p><p>icyumweru gishize cyagenze nabi cyane kuko habayeho ikibazo cyo kubura ibyangombwa kubashoferi bazana imbaho</p><p>ibyobyatumye akazi katagenda uko bikwiye ,ikindi rero ni icyifuzo narimfite ,nkuko mubizi aka kazi nkamazemo igihe kitari kinini ariko ntanubwo ari gito ariko i saha izi sinzi ngo ikintu kijyanye na mobilization gikorwa gute, kuburyo hari abo mpura nabo bakansaba ubusobanuro bujyanye na COMPANY ya RWVCA ,icyo mbaha ni nimero bahamagra ,ubwo niza Emmy ,sinzi niba bamuvugisha.ntizimbye mu magambo rero mudutegurire </p><p>amahugurwa kugirango tumenye byinshi kubijyanye na ASSOCIATION.</p><p>              murakoze </p><p><br></p><p><br></p>', '2026-04-21', '2026-04-21', 113, '2026-04-21 09:14:01', '2026-04-21 09:14:01', '10:59:00', '11:30:00', 'RUSIZI'),
