(789, 'QUARTELY REPORT', 'Other', '<div>QUARTELY REPORT</div><div><br></div><div>&lt;&lt; VAT COLLECTED: 13,910,148 rwf =59.25%</div><div>&lt;&lt; MF RECEIVED: 1,437,418 rwf= 96.79%</div><div>&lt;&lt; NO MEMBER</div><div>&nbsp;TOTAL NCOME= 15,347,566 RWF</div><div><br></div><div><br></div>IMPAMPU NTAGEZE KURI TARGET<div><br></div><div>1. ntabwo cooperative ya KIAKA yigeze yishyura(VAT&amp;MF) muri ikigihembwe cyose gishize.</div><div><br></div><div>2. Ifungwa ry''umupaka (Rubavu-GOMA) bitewe n''icyorezo cya EBORA,&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>3. Target nahawe yashingiye kusoko ry''intebe nabonye 2024 kd 1/2 kirenga cya raporo nabonye muri uwo mwaka cyavuye kumbaho zaguzwe nabantu bakoze intebe, rero kuva icyo gihe nta zindi ntebe zongeye gukorerwa kuri site ya RUBAVU</div>', '2026-04-01', '2026-06-30', 82, '2026-06-30 17:27:08', '2026-06-30 17:27:08', NULL, NULL, ''),
