(868, 'RUSIZI-NYAMASHEKE MONTHLY REPORT OF JULY 2026', 'Monthly', 'Mwiriwe neza,reka nizereko aho muri mur''amahoro.<div>natwe turashima imana ikiturinze,</div><div>rero kubyerekeranye n''akazi ntabwo navugako bimeze neza kuva mukwezi kwa 6 ,nkuko twabibamenyesheje ikibazo cyibura ryimbaho cyakomeje gufata indi ntera i rusizi kuburyo byagezeho abacuruzi bajyana ikibazo cyabo mu karere ariko bambwiyeko akarere kagiye kubishakira umwanzuro,kugeza muri uku kwezi twatangiye kwa8 ntabwo navugako harikiri kugenda i rusizi gusa turi kubona bamwe muba supplier bari gutanga icyizere ko bishobora kugenda neza ubwo turacyategereje.I nyamasheke ho abacuruzi baho bafite ibibazo byinshi ,harimo ko abasarura amashyamba bazamuye ibiciro byimbaho bityo bakaba barikuziranguza nabavuye I KIGALI,bityo bakavugako bo birimo kubagora cn gukora banavugako bamwe bari buze no kubivamo burundu ,mugihe hatarashakirwa umuti w''ibibazo bigaragara harimo n''abacururiza hanze y''agakiriro bitwajeko imbaho zabo bazishyira kukuhanda bategerejeko zerekezwa I kigali.</div><div>MURAKOZE</div>', '2026-08-05', '2026-08-05', 113, '2026-08-05 15:36:46', '2026-08-05 15:36:46', '17:20:00', '17:50:00', 'RUSIZI'),
