(838, 264, 1, 'Printer maintenance: Due to the issue of a black line appearing when printing or making copies through the upper tray, we contacted IMF (printer supplier), who sent a technician to check and fix the problem. The technician, who said he works with IMF, informed us that payment should be made directly to him, not IMF, at a cost of 15,000 RWF. He does not have an EBM invoice, and payment would be made via his phone number (0788712272 Baabu RWAGASORE). He advised that the printer should be cleaned in the affected area, and if the issue persists, we will need to replace that part with a new one that works properly.', 1, 15000.00, 15000.00, '2026-07-14 10:05:28'),
