(1173, 329, 1, 'REQUEST SEPTEMBER N0 005', 1, 180151220.00, 180151220.00, '2026-09-11 11:38:23'),
(1174, 330, 1, 'Dear Finance Department, I am writing to formally requesting you to pay the money for fuel, as the current reserve is nearly depleted. Timely action will ensure that our operations continue without disruption. Thanks.', 1, 1600000.00, 1600000.00, '2026-09-14 07:05:14'),
(1175, 331, 1, 'Dear Finance Department,  As you know, we currently do not have a food supplier, so we have started procuring food items directly.  Yesterday, we purchased vegetables and fish from Simba Supermarket, as reflected on the attached invoice. We kindly request reimbursement of the expenses incurred.', 1, 27300.00, 27300.00, '2026-09-15 07:20:24'),
(1176, 332, 1, 'Dear Finance Department,  I am pleased to write to you to request payment for the technician who assisted us in installing the curtains in the Project Office.  Kindly make the payment to Jean Claude MUGENZI via 0783393305.  Thank you for your cooperation.', 1, 15000.00, 15000.00, '2026-09-15 10:51:50'),
(1177, 333, 1, 'Transport fees', 1, 1500.00, 1500.00, '2026-09-15 12:35:05'),
(1178, 334, 1, 'Request for petty cash ', 1, 150000.00, 150000.00, '2026-09-15 13:36:28'),
(1179, 335, 1, 'Dear finance department; I am pleased to write to you to request funds for the payment of food items that we have purchased, as listed below:  Beef osso buco: 1 kg Irish potatoes: 6 kg Cabbage: 1 piece Kamara bananas: 2 bunches  I would appreciate your assistance in processing this payment.', 1, 22500.00, 22500.00, '2026-09-15 15:28:50'),
(1180, 336, 1, 'Dear Finance Department, we experienced a problem with the faucet used for washing kitchen equipment, as the hoses supplying water to the faucet were damaged. As a result, it was necessary to approach a technician for replacing the damaged hoses with new ones.  A technician has requested payment of RWF 12,500, which covers both the cost of the materials and repair cost.  Kindly process the payment to 0783393305, registered under the name of MUGENZI Jean Claude.  Thank you for your support.', 1, 12500.00, 12500.00, '2026-09-16 09:38:08'),
(1181, 337, 1, 'Request for monthly internet ', 2, 25000.00, 50000.00, '2026-09-17 07:42:48'),
(1182, 338, 1, 'I am writing to kindly request the settlement of the water bill for the water consumed during last month.', 1, 48762.00, 48762.00, '2026-09-17 14:53:19'),
(1183, 339, 1, 'Dear Finance Department,  As you are aware, we now purchase our own supplies directly. We have two meetings scheduled within the next two weeks, and in this regard, I would like to request that you make available 500,000RWF to facilitate these purchases.  We kindly propose that this amount be kept at the office and that funds be disbursed from it whenever we need to make purchases related to these meetings.  Thank you for your support and cooperation.', 1, 500000.00, 500000.00, '2026-09-18 06:41:09'),
(1184, 340, 1, 'REQUEST SEPTEMBER NO 006', 1, 5662439.00, 5662439.00, '2026-09-18 07:46:44'),
(1185, 341, 1, 'REQUEST SEPTEMBER NO 001', 1, 5162439.00, 5162439.00, '2026-09-18 08:21:57'),
(1186, 342, 1, 'Request for water bill payment', 1, 48761.00, 48761.00, '2026-09-21 08:38:37'),
(1187, 343, 1, 'Dear Finance Department, On 19 September 2026, chicken meat 2kgs was purchased. I kindly request that this transaction be recorded and reconciled in the accounting records.  Thank you.', 2, 8000.00, 16000.00, '2026-09-21 08:41:00'),
(1188, 344, 1, 'Dear Finance Department, On 16 September 2026, chicken meat 2kgs was purchased. I kindly request that this transaction be recorded and reconciled in the accounting records. Thank you.', 2, 8000.00, 16000.00, '2026-09-21 08:46:04'),
(1189, 345, 1, 'Dear Finance Department,  On 19/09/2026, we purchased 3 kg of chicken meat and 2 kg of fish in preparation for the meeting scheduled for 21/09/2026.  Kindly record and reconcile these expenses in the accounting system. The supporting payment receipts are being kept by Claudine.', 1, 47000.00, 47000.00, '2026-09-21 08:52:05'),
(1190, 346, 1, 'REQUEST SEPTEMBER N0 008', 1, 24103728.00, 24103728.00, '2026-09-24 07:59:17'),
(1191, 347, 1, 'Dear Finance department, I would like to request approval for the amount of one hundred thousand Rwandan Francs (100,000 RWF) spent on food, taken from the petty cash, as indicated in the requisition and the corresponding invoices.', 1, 100000.00, 100000.00, '2026-09-24 12:12:02'),
(1192, 348, 1, 'Dear Finance department, I would like to request approval for the amount of one hundred thousand Rwandan Francs (100,000 RWF) spent on food, taken from the petty cash, as indicated in the requisition and the corresponding invoices.', 1, 100000.00, 100000.00, '2026-09-24 12:32:27'),
(1193, 349, 1, 'Dear ED,  Further to our earlier communication regarding the unfortunate passing of one of the Association’s members, Madame Mukangoboka Josiane, who passed away on 22 September 2026, I respectfully submit this request for your consideration.  Pursuant to the resolutions adopted by the RWVCA General Assembly, the family of a deceased member is entitled to receive bereavement support in the amount of RWF 500,000.  In light of the above, I kindly seek your approval for the disbursement of this support to the bereaved family as stipulated in the Association''s resolutions and welfare provisions.  Your favorable consideration of this request will be highly appreciated.  Yours sincerely,', 1, 500000.00, 500000.00, '2026-09-25 08:01:04'),
(1194, 350, 1, 'Dear Finance Department I am writing to respectfully request the refund/reimbursement of the funds spent on the funeral wreath for our late member, Josiane MUKANGOBOKA.', 1, 15000.00, 15000.00, '2026-09-26 10:49:44'),
(1195, 351, 1, 'Request for Payment of Staff Food (Fresh Vegetables)', 1, 17365.00, 17365.00, '2026-09-28 08:12:33');
